cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Lugas supports your work, cite the software and the exact dataset release used."
title: "Lugas"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Lugas is a free, local, open skill and toolset for
  paraphrasing, editing, correcting, and translating academic and technical
  writing in Indonesian and English while preserving numbers, citations,
  negation, uncertainty, and scientific claim strength. It includes an
  offline meaning guard, an Indonesian EYD V/KBBI lint, an Agent Skill, a
  Python CLI/API, a static PWA workbench, and an original pattern catalog.
authors:
